<p><a href="https://alexiforus.com" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign website</a></p>
<p>Alexi Giannoulias has not published a mayoral platform - none exists anywhere on his campaign site. The policies below are his Secretary of State priorities, shown because they are the only platform he has bothered to make public.</p>
